@startuml
title OC-D06 Fiscal Status Visibility and Exception Handoff

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Operator /\nSupervisor" as User
component "Operator Console\nFiscal Status Viewer" as Console
component "Central PMS\nFiscal Read Model" as Central
component "Central PMS\nFiscal Reference Store" as Reference
component "POS Server\nfiscal issuance evidence\nalready recorded only" as Pos
component "Future Fiscal\nException Queue" as Queue
component "Management Dashboard /\nReporting" as Dashboard
component "Audit / Event" as Audit

User --> Console : View fiscal status
Console --> Central : Request read-only fiscal context
Central --> Reference : Read fiscal reference state
Reference --> Central : State, evidence status,\nnumber assignment, error posture
Central --> Console : Read-only fiscal status
Console --> Audit : Record fiscal status view

Central -[#blue]-> Pos : POS Server evidence only when\nalready recorded by Central PMS
Console -[#red,dashed]-> Pos : no direct POS Server calls

Central --> Queue : Future retry/readback/writeback handoff
Queue --> Dashboard : Aggregate exception visibility
Central --> Dashboard : Fiscal visibility projection / feed

note bottom
Fiscal visibility is read-only in this SDD.
Retry, readback, writeback, and closure mechanics belong to the future Fiscal Exception Queue design.
end note

@enduml
